{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Idle Cultivation",
    "steam_appid": 3697240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Cultivation is an idle RPG inspired by Chinese mythology and games. Cultivate by absorbing spiritual energy through special techniques and break through to greater realms, growing stronger in your pursuit of immortality. Fight against increasingly powerful beasts, monsters and experts to secure generous loot. Develop the myriad arts to support you on your journey to the top. Cultivate, fight, loot, train, gather, craft, and develop your character in this idle journey. Can you become an Immortal? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697240/extras/0f9f1c5f03af4499a7c667c373d1e6c2.avif?t=1753950901\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure into locations and dungeons that contain powerful beasts, monsters and other experts to receive powerful loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697240/extras/994512e33a76ddc96775a210f79c83cc.avif?t=1753950901\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 6 deadly types of weapon to defeat your enemies. Use the five elements, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water, Wood, to deal extra damage to your foes. All elements are countered by another element and choosing the correct one can change the tide of the fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697240/extras/a010bf12aa96e9df6e89d081cb2fadbc.avif?t=1753950901\" width=378 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your skills to become peerless. There are 10 skills that you can level up from 1-100. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation : The main skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind, Body, Dao, and Array are assisting skills that will make cultivation, combat and other skills more efficient and powerful. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy, Forging, Talisman, Mining, and Gardening are crafting and gathering skills. These allow you to gather materials and create powerful items that will help you on your path to immortality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also powerful cultivation manuals that will either help you in battle, or in your cultivation, that you can discover in dungeons.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle Cultivation is an idle RPG inspired by Chinese mythology and games. Cultivate by absorbing spiritual energy through special techniques and break through to greater realms, growing stronger in your pursuit of immortality. Fight against increasingly powerful beasts, monsters and experts to secure generous loot. Develop the myriad arts to support you on your journey to the top. Cultivate, fight, loot, train, gather, craft, and develop your character in this idle journey. Can you become an Immortal? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697240/extras/0f9f1c5f03af4499a7c667c373d1e6c2.avif?t=1753950901\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure into locations and dungeons that contain powerful beasts, monsters and other experts to receive powerful loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697240/extras/994512e33a76ddc96775a210f79c83cc.avif?t=1753950901\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between 6 deadly types of weapon to defeat your enemies. Use the five elements, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water, Wood, to deal extra damage to your foes. All elements are countered by another element and choosing the correct one can change the tide of the fight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697240/extras/a010bf12aa96e9df6e89d081cb2fadbc.avif?t=1753950901\" width=378 height=151 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your skills to become peerless. There are 10 skills that you can level up from 1-100. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivation : The main skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind, Body, Dao, and Array are assisting skills that will make cultivation, combat and other skills more efficient and powerful. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy, Forging, Talisman, Mining, and Gardening are crafting and gathering skills. These allow you to gather materials and create powerful items that will help you on your path to immortality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also powerful cultivation manuals that will either help you in battle, or in your cultivation, that you can discover in dungeons.</p>",
